      "end": 795,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "3. Learned counsel for the petitioner informs that the petitioner and the victim are presently residing together, have solemnized their marriage, and from the said wedlock, a male child aged about 1.5 years has been born.",
